From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IamMaxim <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 31 May 2026 14:24:59 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] brand: rename zed:// URL scheme to zedium://

Rename the deep-link and internal JSON-schema URI scheme from zed:// to
zedium:// across the parser (open_listener), all emitters, the schema store
(SCHEMA_URI_PREFIX, LSP_SETTINGS_SCHEMA_URL_PREFIX), default.json $schema,
cli URL_PREFIX, OS registration (ZED_URL_SCHEME), and the test assertions.
Fixes the patch-0027 mismatch where macOS registered the zedium:// scheme
while the code still emitted/parsed zed://.

Also set default edit_predictions.provider from the removed "zed" variant
to "none": default.json failed strict deserialization since patch 0023
dropped EditPredictionProvider::Zed, which had silently broken the entire
workspace test suite. Zedium ships no hosted edit-prediction provider.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
